{
  "name": "Optiquity content pipeline — WEBHOOK (render)",
  "active": false,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## WEBHOOK flow — lower latency, one real constraint\n\nSame `render` submit as the POLL example, but it hands the shim a `callback_url` = **`{{ $execution.resumeUrl }}`** and pauses on a **Wait (On Webhook Call)** node. When the job settles the pipeline POSTs a **wake-up** to that URL (a nudge, never the result), the execution resumes, and we still fetch the finished output through the authenticated `/poll`.\n\n**⚠ The constraint (read before using):** the shim's callback guard is **opt-in** and **fail-closed**. It only calls back to a host that is (a) listed in `callbacks.allowed_hosts` in `instance/shim.yaml` **and** (b) resolves to a **public** IP. A **localhost / LAN / behind-NAT** n8n cannot receive the callback (its resume-URL host is non-global → refused by the SSRF block). So this flow needs **n8n Cloud** or a **self-hosted n8n on a public domain / tunnel**, with that host allow-listed in the shim. Otherwise use `pipeline-poll.json` — the poll needs no inbound reachability.",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000101",
      "name": "Sticky: webhook caveat",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -260,
        -200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### The Wait (On Webhook Call) node\nSet **HTTP Method = POST** and **Authentication = None** — the pipeline's wake-up POST carries no auth secret (the security boundary is the shim's outbound allow-list + SSRF guard, not this inbound node).\n\nThe wake-up body arrives here as `$json.body`:\n`{ event, job:{key,workspace,target_ids}, poll, [code, redrivable] }`.",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000102",
      "name": "Sticky: wait node",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        620,
        -180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "b2000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000101",
      "name": "Start",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        60,
        320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://127.0.0.1:8787/invoke",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"verb\": \"render\",\n  \"workspace\": \"<WORKSPACE>\",\n  \"params\": {\n    \"item\": \"<ARTIFACT_ID>\",\n    \"platform\": \"linkedin\",\n    \"language\": \"en\",\n    \"output_type\": \"docx\",\n    \"presentation\": \"plain\",\n    \"callback_url\": \"{{ $execution.resumeUrl }}\"\n  }\n}",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "fullResponse": true,
              "neverError": true,
              "responseFormat": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "b2000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000102",
      "name": "Submit render + callback",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        280,
        320
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Optiquity Shim Header Auth"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c3000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000101",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.statusCode }}",
              "rightValue": 200,
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b2000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000103",
      "name": "Sync cache-hit?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        520,
        320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resume": "webhook",
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "responseCode": 200,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b2000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000104",
      "name": "Wait for callback",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        760,
        440
      ],
      "webhookId": "d4000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000101"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c3000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000102",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.event }}",
